  "reflectionText": "The psalmist cried: my God, my God, why have you forsaken me? My bones are out of joint. He turned in the same psalm: I will declare your name to my brothers. He has not despised the afflicted. Have you ever prayed a forsaken prayer that later became the song the assembly will yet sing?"
